  "findings": [
    "Bounded support: nested empty/closed/EOL styles, closing aliases, Unicode boundaries, restoration around a missing sprite, and activity/state/note consumers pass. Java CommandCreoleBuilder orders closed then EOL candidates; CommandCreoleStyle.matchingSize returns captured body length. New walk_style_tag follows that selection for the supported bare styles. No fixture-dependent branch or unexplained changed constant was found.",
    "Counterexample html_escape_pairs and minimal s_html_bold_backslash: Java CharHidder.hide consumes backslash-tilde into a hidden literal tilde before matching and recursive traversal. Rust walk_style_tag skips that pair while searching for a closing candidate but walk_segments has no corresponding backslash arm when painting the captured body. Rust emits a\\~ versus Java a~. This was already failing before the packet; it disproves complete escaped-candidate handling, not a lost pass.",
    "Counterexample html_parameters: q<size:19></size>r<color:navy></color>s produces separate q/r/s Java text atoms but a merged qrs Rust atom. Java StripeSimple.modifyStripe/addPending flushes each selected size/color command; the unchanged Rust size/color arms recurse into an empty body without a barrier. Its second size31 line also exposes the separately owned sequence baseline (Java95.7695, Rust78.3672). Both are retained failures, not newly lost passes.",
    "html_extended remains a pre-existing unsupported activation surface: FontStyle allows color-bearing u/w/strike and mixed-case BACK, while Rust handle_tag recognizes a narrower set. The packet adds aliases but does not establish the complete Java activation grammar.",
    "html_url_math has an exact URL label slice but no clean whole positive reference: the pinned runner lacks Batik and embeds a formula fallback. Preserve it as reference-environment residue, not a Java semantics assertion or a positive pass."
  ],
  "causal_locations": {
    "java": [
      "klimt/creole/legacy/CommandCreoleBuilder#constructor: createLegacy before createLegacyEol for BOLD,ITALIC,UNDERLINE,STRIKE,WAVE,BACKCOLOR",
